  "name": "Devious Strike",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/weapons/daggers/dagger-curved-blue.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Beginning at 5th level, when you deal Sneak Attack damage, you can forgo some of your Sneak Attack dice to produce a special effect. The save DC equals 8 + your Dexterity modifier + your proficiency bonus.</p><ul><li><strong>Trip (Cost: 1d6).</strong> The target must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or be knocked prone.</li><li><strong>Withdraw (Cost: 1d6).</strong> You can move up to half your speed without provoking opportunity attacks immediately after dealing the damage.</li></ul>",
